{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01173",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.5,
      "end_seconds": 6.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.02,
      "end_seconds": 12.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.49,
      "end_seconds": 16.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "so, I've been feeling sick, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.74,
      "end_seconds": 24.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.06,
      "end_seconds": 29.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "it's been ten days, I'm fairly sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.5,
      "end_seconds": 33.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.96,
      "end_seconds": 40.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Severe, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.74,
      "end_seconds": 43.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.13,
      "end_seconds": 59.98,
      "duration_seconds": 14.85,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get throbbing headaches on one side as well. About throbbing headaches on one side, I'd say a few times a day. It's worse with bright light."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.55,
      "end_seconds": 76.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.22,
      "end_seconds": 81.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.62,
      "end_seconds": 85.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.44,
      "end_seconds": 95.74,
      "duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "text": "I had a triple bypass eight years ago. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.43,
      "end_seconds": 100.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Anything you do to to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.02,
      "end_seconds": 105.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.32,
      "end_seconds": 108.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.93,
      "end_seconds": 112.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.72,
      "end_seconds": 119.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "What about your medical history? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.72,
      "end_seconds": 125.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "I've had migraines, yes. I've had heart disease, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.93,
      "end_seconds": 129.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.88,
      "end_seconds": 134.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "I'm on sumatriptan, when needed for my migraines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.56,
      "end_seconds": 137.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.77,
      "end_seconds": 158.34,
      "duration_seconds": 18.57,
      "text": "50 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. It's clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.2,
      "end_seconds": 162.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "How long have you taken that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.78,
      "end_seconds": 168.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "For about a year. It's paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.23,
      "end_seconds": 184.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "And what about weakness, stiff neck or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.49,
      "end_seconds": 189.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.74,
      "end_seconds": 193.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "understood did you notice any head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.13,
      "end_seconds": 196.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "no head injury, thankfully"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.38,
      "end_seconds": 201.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.56,
      "end_seconds": 204.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "no, nothing with my heart"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.07,
      "end_seconds": 210.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Okay, anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.91,
      "end_seconds": 215.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "no changes there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.91,
      "end_seconds": 220.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.56,
      "end_seconds": 232.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "right, keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.24,
      "end_seconds": 251.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 112 over 70, heart rate 65, SpO2 98 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.73,
      "end_seconds": 254.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.93,
      "end_seconds": 259.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.77,
      "end_seconds": 263.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.13,
      "end_seconds": 280.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.38,
      "end_seconds": 283.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.27,
      "end_seconds": 304.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Your eye movements are normal and and there is no weakness in your arms or legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.47,
      "end_seconds": 316.72,
      "duration_seconds": 9.25,
      "text": "You can relax now. Okay, so my impression is this: It points towards migraine with aura. Tension-type headache is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.94,
      "end_seconds": 321.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.74,
      "end_seconds": 339.78,
      "duration_seconds": 18.04,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like migraine with aura, but I'd like to confirm. A headache diary is what I'd like next, for migraine. Keep A headache diary and avoid skipping meals. See me again in six weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.1,
      "end_seconds": 343.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.22,
      "end_seconds": 347.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.96,
      "end_seconds": 350.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}